title: 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_영문
---
(It's the last class before heading home.)
(Maybe it's because the semester is at its peak, but my whole body feels heavy and exhausted.)
<<show san_idle>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Whoa, why the long face today?
{name()}: I think I'm just burnt out lately...
ASan: Have you been to the doctor?
{name()}: It's not that serious. I'm fine.
ASan: .......
<<show san_smile>>
<<play san_sound>>
ASan: That settles it. Let's ditch this class.
{name()}: Say what????????
{name()}: You actually know the word "ditch"?
{name()}: Even though this is the OOP lecture?
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: I'm saying this because I'm worried about you! Why are you judging me?
{name()}: Oh, sorry. My bad.
{name()}: Then... want to skip it together?
<<if get("lvSan") >= 20>>
    <<jump 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_긍정_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_부정_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_긍정_영문
---
<<show san_idle>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: You mean together?
{name()}: Yeah.
{name()}: It's boring alone.
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Hmm....
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Well, I guess every college student needs to pull a "sign-and-run" at least once.
ASan: Want to go to the club room and play some games?
{name()}: The club room?
ASan: Yeah. It’s always been on my bucket list.
{name()}: Sure, let's go play some games.
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
<<show san_idle>>
{name()}: Any games you like?
ASan: Yep.
ASan: It's a multiplayer, team-based FPS where heroes team up to fight for objectives.
ASan: Sounds fun just hearing about it, right?
ASan: Hurry up and turn on the PC!
<<play 공통_키보드>>
<<wait 1>>
<<show san_neg>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: Ugh, seriously, what is up with these healers?
ASan: Especially this 'LastGamer05' dude.
ASan: He's just standing in the back doing absolutely nothing!
(ASan keeps grumbling about the healers...)
(But honestly, catching a glimpse of her screen, it didn't look like it was entirely the healer's fault.)
<<choice 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_긍정1_영문 "Yeah, I think he's the one who messed up most." 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_부정1_영문 "Duh, it's totally the healer's fault.">>
ASan: You think so too, right?
===

title: 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Yeah, I think he's the one who messed up the most.
{name()}: But I also think you were overextending a bit, so the team's synergy was a bit off.
<<show san_neg>>
ASan: Overextending?
{name()}: Well, look at it this way. Your character was here, right?.....
(I gave ASan some feedback while watching the replay.)
(Fortunately, there wasn't much to nitpick, and though she was annoyed at first, she eventually understood.)
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Wow, I guess it's because I'm Bronze 5, but I had no idea.
<<show san_smile>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Thanks to you, I feel like I can finally make it to Silver!!!!!!!
{name()}: That's good. Your game sense is actually pretty high, so I think you'll climb the ranks fast.
<<show san_blush>>
<<change lvSan 15>>
<<like 신아산>>
ASan: ........
ASan: Then... want to duo with me?
{name()}: Oh, really?
{name()}: To be honest, I'm actually a Master in this game. I'll hop on my smurf account.
ASan: What? So you're gonna carry me?
{name()}: I can't guarantee anything, but....
{name()}: Most likely?
<<show san_smile>>
ASan: Awesome!!!!!!!
<<hide>>
<<bg 신아산_특수>>
<<play 공통_키보드>>
(And so, I lost track of time playing games with ASan.)
ASan: Oh my god, I hit Silver!!!!!!!!!!!
{name()}: See? Not bad, right?
ASan: Yeah, totally!!!
ASan: Gaming with you is surprisingly fun.
ASan: You'll play with me again next time, right?
{name()}: Of course.
{name()}: Your skills will probably be even better by then, so I'll face you on my Master account.
ASan: Deal!
<<end>>
===

title: 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_부정1_영문
