title: 주3_수_3교시_강의실_신아산_특수_긍정2_영문
---
{name()}: Well.... I'm not bad?
ASan: Then hurry up and type for me.
ASan: You need to back me up in the chat right now!!!!!!!!!!!
{name()}: Wait, what????????
<<hide>>
<<bg 신아산_특수>>
(Before I knew it, I was sitting right next to ASan.)
ASan: Go on, tell 'em.
{name()}: Uh, uh, uh...
ASan: Hurry!!!! We're running out of time!!!!!
{name()}: Hey, you ****! If you play like that, no wonder...
<<play 공통_키보드>>
(I had no choice but to unleash a storm of insults at a total stranger on ASan's behalf.....)
(Sorry, 'LastGamer05'...)
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
<<show san_smile>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<change lvSan 10>>
ASan: Phew, that felt so satisfying.
ASan: Thanks!
ASan: You're really good with words.
{name()}: Uh, yeah... thanks...
ASan: Next time I play, I'm putting you on chat duty~.
{name()}: What???? No way. You'll get perma-banned.
ASan: Who cares?
ASan: Hanging out with you like this is way more fun anyway.
ASan: Let's do it again!
(ASan left the club room with an innocent smile on her face.)
<<end>>
===

